Package: carmar
Type: Package
Title: CarmaR - an R Notebook That Runs on Your Own R
Version: 0.33
Authors@R: person("Mohammed", "Saqr", email = "saqr@saqr.me", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A single-file R notebook served from a local kernel: your R, your
    packages, your files. The package carries the notebook and its kernel;
    carmar::run() starts the kernel (or reuses a running one) and opens the
    notebook in the browser. Built for classrooms: one install, one call.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    httpuv,
    jsonlite,
    openssl,
    processx
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
